# Names only. The real file is /etc/forever-market-feed/backup.env on the server (owner fmf-deploy, mode 0600)
# and never enters Git, GitHub, logs or a chat. README.md (section Server) has the no-echo command that writes it.
#
# One line per name, NAME=value, no quotes and no spaces around the equals sign.
#
# FORPSI Object Storage (Aruba Cloud) has no separate S3 keys: the access key ID is the storage account's name and
# the secret key its password, so the account belongs to the feed alone. The repository is a prefix in its bucket;
# `forever-market-feed-backup init` creates the bucket when it does not exist yet.
RESTIC_REPOSITORY=s3:https://r1-cz.storage.forpsicloud.cz/<bucket>/forever-market-feed
AWS_ACCESS_KEY_ID=<storage account name>
AWS_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY=<storage account password>
AWS_DEFAULT_REGION=R1-CZ
